      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Added",
          "category": "added",
          "items": [
            "<strong>Retrace</strong> — load your <code>mapping.txt</code> and read R8/ProGuard-obfuscated stack traces in place, in live streams and opened files. <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qwerfunch/logcat-on-releases/main/assets/1.2.0/feature_retrace.png\" alt=\"Retrace: an R8/ProGuard-obfuscated stack trace restored to original class and method names after loading mapping.txt\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cursor-zoom-in\" data-zoom>",
            "<strong>Copy crash report</strong> — right-click a crash and copy a share-ready report: device, Android/app version, and the stack trace. <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qwerfunch/logcat-on-releases/main/assets/1.2.0/feature_copy_crash_report.png\" alt=\"Copy crash report: right-click a crash line, choose Copy crash report, and paste a ready-to-share report with device, OS and full stack trace\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cursor-zoom-in\" data-zoom>",
            "<strong>Tag colors &amp; grouping</strong> — every tag gets its own color; repeated tags show once. Toggle in Settings. <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qwerfunch/logcat-on-releases/main/assets/1.2.0/feature_tag_colors.png\" alt=\"Tag colors &amp; grouping: every tag gets a distinct color and repeated tags collapse into one, with crash blocks outlined in the stream\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"cursor-zoom-in\" data-zoom>",
            "<strong>Update prompt</strong> — new versions announce themselves on launch, with release notes. Close to skip that version."
          ],
          "paragraphs": []
        },
        {
          "title": "Fixed",
          "category": "fixed",
          "items": [
            "Crash outline stays visible while its menu is open; ghost tag no longer overlaps the next one.",
            "Crash-report copy honors the Full/Msg toggle; highlighted tags stay visible when grouping is on."
          ],
          "paragraphs": []
        }
